# ── Example outputs ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The following input files are committed alongside the notebooks:
#   3D inputs  : cube.stl  cube.xyz  Armadillo.stl
#   2D inputs  : ne_50m_admin_0_countries.{json,shp,shx}
#                gpw_v4_population_density_rev11_2020_1_deg.tif
#   README GIFs: cube.gif  square.gif  (kept via negation rules below)
#
# Anything produced when notebooks run is ignored.

# Tracking export sub-directories
examples/vderm_exports/
examples/vderm_2d_exports/
examples/my_deformation/
examples/paraview*/

# Generated CSV outputs (2D pipeline — lite and geo workflows)
examples/*.csv

# Generated point-cloud / mesh outputs (3D pipeline)
